+    CSM(ASCII)|CSM(JISX201)|CSM(JISX208)|CSM(HWKANA_7BIT)|CSM(JISX212)|CSM(GB2312)|CSM(KSC5601)|CSM(ISO8859_1)|CSM(ISO8859_7),
+    CSM(ASCII)|CSM(JISX201)|CSM(JISX208)|CSM(HWKANA_7BIT)|CSM(JISX212)|CSM(GB2312)|CSM(KSC5601)|CSM(ISO8859_1)|CSM(ISO8859_7)
