+ *                          U_INDEX_OUTOFBOUNDS_ERROR if src contains
+ *                          too many code points.
+ *                          U_BUFFER_OVERFLOW_ERROR if destCapacity is not enough
+ * @return The length of the result string, if successful - or in case of a buffer overflow,
