+/**
+ * Script usage constants.
+ * See UAX #31 Unicode Identifier and Pattern Syntax.
+ * http://www.unicode.org/reports/tr31/#Table_Candidate_Characters_for_Exclusion_from_Identifiers
+ *
+ * @stable ICU 51
